        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bál deeloodá' ure kitaábuú Mose kuna soomuús dír muu sleémeero, kari xuú' adór múk Amoni nee oo Moabu ir harinká dahmuú baraá dinku'uumár múk Munguhe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma múk Israeli qoomár niwa baraá yaamaá Misri wa ti'iít ngaa muruú /aymár i hanisi'iiká laqaá tam ma'aá wahaangw, kitaangose a Bala'amu nguna buiyé' as múk Israeli nguwa lu'usi, ala Munguúrén lo'oodá' gana warqeés tay tsuuqa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomár múk Israeli dabeerí ngiwa axaás múk xoordá' hatlá' ngway paraatliyé' dir'ine.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomár bál deeloodá' ur niwa xeeriiká kaahamusmo Eliashibu kudá' taa tsawaár as kutuwoó doó Munguúrén nguwa xun, inós nee Tobia ti oohiyá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutuwír ur gana amohhe'eés as Tobia, kutuwidá' ta ilahhooár balaángwí qamaamín nee ar mooyaango nee xoosla, nee ilahhooár balaangw ar gár wák baraá mibaango nee difaái nee di/i, tidá' taa hara'ayín kawa hanmiisi dír múk tlahhoó Laáwi nee daauuse, nee xuumuusér afér doó Mungú, nee ilahhooa as kaahamuusér Mungú. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomár muruuwí iwa tleehharuút aníng a Yerusalemúr i diriaaká, asma baraá kurkú mibeeri tám nee tsár oo waawuti'iimár Artashasta oo yaamaá Babuloniro, aníng ana amór waawutumoó káw, aluuwo iri ya/án niwa kii/ Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niwa kií/ Yerusalemu tlakweemaaká' Eliashibu Tobia nguwa kutuwír i amohhe'eés baraá doó Munguhe aníng ngiri tsaáhh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng ana ló'wa buúhh xooslaá Tobia sleémeero ngay tsee/áy kwaáhh baraá kutuwidae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muu una ádbáw kutuwaydá' kuwa hhohhoeesi, xooslaá doó Mungú nee ilahhooár balaango, nee mooyaango.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Slám ngay malé tsaáhh adór múk tlahhoó Laáwi hariímar'ín ngira slay'iiká, naxés múk tlahhoó Laáwi nee daauuse, kudá' geeraawo gadiyuusá', umuú heewo iri kií/ baraá qaymoorós. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geeraharuuse ana igahhaát ngiri báw, «Asma milá doó Mungú gár kusa máy.» Inooín sleémeero ngiri burumbuúr, ngiri ki/ís baraá gadiyeé. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo múk Israeli sleémeero ilahhooár balaangw ar wák baraá mibaango oo balaangw nee baraá difaáiro, nee baraá di/to kuri qaás baraá kuuntáy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muu nguri tsawaár oo kuuntáy gu amohhe'eemiís, kaahamusmo Shelemia nee goousmo Sadoki nee Pedaia heé tlahhoó Laáwi. Nee Hanani garmoó Sakuri, garmoó Matania tawa alee/isusmooín. Inooín i inkihhimuú koná' nee gadiyér'ín a mura' kun qasmiis dír hhaeeín.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aá Munguúeé', án inslawáng baraá muruuwihe, tlehhmi'iieé' kudá' hho' naa tleehhahhiít as do'ók nee as gadiyeérók mi fitsaar.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Deeloodár kilae múk Yuda una ár i sabiíbuú tsoo/itiyá' deelór Sabaátoro, bahh'alé daqwaayer'ín ngaa huwaárí tsa/aasiyé' ar difaáiro, nee sabiíbuuwo, nee /aantsihe, nee umuúqo gaaro ki huuw gixsár Yerusalemu. Ngiri gurbuú' adór deelór Sabaátoro weermis ir qonká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Múk Tiro kudá' baraá gixsár hoót siyó nguna huwiyé' nee muruú hatlae baraá gixsár Yerusalemu, nguri weerimisiyé' bál deelór Sabaátoro dír múk Yuda nee múk Yerusalemúr hoót. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geeraharuusér múk Yuda ana iigahhaát, ana oó', «Tlakweemaaká' ta tlehhtá' a milá awa deelór Sabaáto kawa meetagaamisa'? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Xáy baabi'iihúng adoorí ngaa tleehhi'iikáhe, nee Munguúrén atén taa slahh'amuú úr i huwikáhe nee gixsarihe? Hám a malé buhhtaawós huwtá wa sla'á' gawaá múk Israeli ar Sabaáto kawa meetagamisa'.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo niri oó', afér gixsár Yerusalemu ka tsegiiti tsiindaá deelór Sabaáto bir iimu/u/uún qoomár iimi bir giwtír slá', slám makawa gweér ay dír Sabaáto i fak. Sagadiyuuser'eé' bahh'alé ana qaás dír afér gixsa, nee ngiri báw tam hee gár wák mingiwa huúw baraá gixsa bál Sabaátoro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ay ki/ima tsár halanuuse i muruú haahúp, ala aqo nina tsee/aá gixsár i qaatiyé'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ina gurbu'uúm ngiwa babaw, «Gár tas tsee/aá gixsár i qaqatiinda' i káhh. Binda malé ki/é' daxta a aandá'.» Gawaá adoorihe, naa baloó ki/i'iiká daqemuuwo bál Sabaátoro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Múk tlahhoó Laáwi una ádbáw tiwa kilooín hhohhoeesiya', niwa hardihiya' afér gixsa ngiwa xuna deelór Sabaátór hhoohhooe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munguúeé', án inslawáng, tam tihe, gurtlawáng ar harqoomoó yaareemaá sla'aarirók tidá' warqawaaká.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Slám deeloodae múk Yahudi sleeme una ár oo /ameenár Ashdodi gaa duxuut nee ar Amoni nee ar Moabu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tlaqtá na/ii'ín a tsifrír Ashdodi ngin ar axweesiyá', ala tsifrír Yuda ngi aleeslay'aaká ar axweesanto, ala a tsifrír múk hatlá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ina iigahhaát, ngiri lu'umís, bahh'ale ngiri muúx, kookariya' ina se'eengw uuruxuúm. Ina /uurutimís ngiwa lo'ór /aymiis ar umuú Mungú ngiwa babaw, «Dasuuhúng mukuwa duxuút nee daaqay'ín, tam daaqayhúng dasuuín munguwa duxuút, laqaá tam kuungaá kilá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Xáy Solomon aa dakuusikáhe as /ameenár adór tí? Inós a waawutmoó úr ta waawituú xoorduuwo slám Munguúwós gwaa slaá', Mungú guri waawutmoó Israeli wa qaás, ala tam adoorihe /ameenadár xoordaá hatlá' guri tlakweemár eér. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Xáy atén kuungá' nun iiárií qaasána baraá /aymuú tlaakwe, nee tlakweemaá yaariir awa adór kuká' kiri tleehhaán tam Munguúrén kway tlakweemáy tleehhaán as /ameenarí kawa duxuta'?»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
