              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munguúeé', inslaweek adoodá' kahamuusi'iima ngira meetagaasiyé' nee alqadór kahamuusi'iimaro nee ar tlahhoó Laáwiwo.",
          "type": "text",
